// - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
// Filename:	TS060 290-033 Oblique Driver & ArrayPCB.test
// Project:		CL Auto 2
// Author:      Foster & Freeman Ltd - Paul Evans
// Modified:    04/11/25
//
// Description: This script test the Driver and LED output for the Oblique.
// - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -

{0} force FAIL by default to avoid IMPORTANT message below.
#1: Equipment Setup 1.
a. Connect the Bus Priate and PSU to the test PC.
b. Connect the Bus Priate to the TE247 and set the pull-up shut to ON.
c. Connect the GND's to - of channel 1 on the PSU.
d. Connect the VPWR to + of channel 1 on the PSU.
e. Set the TENMA Programmable PSU power switch to on.
CLICK_OK:
CONNECT: TENMAPSU
IF_NOT:
GOTO: #1: 

#2: Equipment Setup 2 & Configure the PSU.
a. Connect the UUT to the test LED array.
b. Place the UUT inside the test box with camera.
c. Enter the PCB serial number.
COMMAND: TENMAPSU OUT0
COMMAND: TENMAPSU OCP1
COMMAND: TENMAPSU OCPSET1:0.750
COMMAND: TENMAPSU VSET1:12.00
COMMAND: TENMAPSU ISET1:0.450
CLICK_OK:

#3: Connect and Configure the Bus Pirate.
CONNECT: BUS_PIRATE
IF_NOT:
GOTO: #3:
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE m4
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE 3
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE W // sets the power rail to on, and drives a voltage to pin 5 C_PWR_ON
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE P

#4: Power supply enabled.
COMMAND: TENMAPSU OUTCH1:1
CLICK_OK:

#5: Ready to begin the test?
//ConfigMCGPIO
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x0A 0x80} {0x4A 0x00 0x07} {0x4A 0x10 0x00}
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x1A 0x0F}{0x4A 0x0A 0x00} //All Leds OFF
CLICK_OK:

#6: White LED Test – all 4 quads (LOW)
// 60ma
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x0A 0x20}{0x4A 0x1A 0x00}{0x4A 0x1A 0x20}
DELAY: 1500
COMMAND: TENMAPSU IOUT1?
READLINE: TENMAPSU PSUcurrent
The returned current is =  %PSUcurrent%
RANGE: %PSUcurrent% 0.020 0.005 // set the range as per TS014_TEST_SEQUENCER_scripts.docx 						
SUB: TestPassOrFail
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x1A 0x0F}{0x4A 0x0A 0x00} //All Leds OFF

#7: White LED Test – all 4 quads (MID)
//80mA
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x0A 0x20}{0x4A 0x1A 0x00}{0x4A 0x1A 0x80}
DELAY: 1500
COMMAND: TENMAPSU IOUT1?
READLINE: TENMAPSU PSUcurrent
The returned current is =  %PSUcurrent%
RANGE: %PSUcurrent% 0.080 0.005 // set the range as per TS014_TEST_SEQUENCER_scripts.docx 						
SUB: TestPassOrFail
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x1A 0x0F}{0x4A 0x0A 0x00} //All Leds OFF

#8: White LED Test – all 4 quads (MAX)
//181mA
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x0A 0x20}{0x4A 0x1A 0x00}{0x4A 0x1A 0xE0}
DELAY: 1500
COMMAND: TENMAPSU IOUT1?
READLINE: TENMAPSU PSUcurrent
The returned current is =  %PSUcurrent%
RANGE: %PSUcurrent% 0.180 0.005 // set the range as per TS014_TEST_SEQUENCER_scripts.docx 						
SUB: TestPassOrFail
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x1A 0x0F}{0x4A 0x0A 0x00} //All Leds OFF

#9: White LED Test - turn ON Quad A.
//20mA
Did 3 LEDs turn on?
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x0A 0x20}{0x4A 0x1A 0x00} {0x4A 0x1A 0x87}
PASS_FAIL:
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x1A 0x0F}{0x4A 0x0A 0x00} //All Leds OFF

#10: White LED Test - turn ON Quad B.
//20mA
Did 3 LEDs turn on?
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x0A 0x20}{0x4A 0x1A 0x00} {0x4A 0x1A 0x8E}
PASS_FAIL:
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x1A 0x0F}{0x4A 0x0A 0x00} //All Leds OFF

#11: White LED Test - turn ON Quad C.
//20mA
Did 3 LEDs turn on?
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x0A 0x20}{0x4A 0x1A 0x00} {0x4A 0x1A 0x8B}
PASS_FAIL:
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x1A 0x0F}{0x4A 0x0A 0x00} //All Leds OFF

#12: White LED Test - turn ON Quad D.
//20mA
Did 3 LEDs turn on?
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x0A 0x20}{0x4A 0x1A 0x00} {0x4A 0x1A 0x8D}
PASS_FAIL:
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x1A 0x0F}{0x4A 0x0A 0x00} //All Leds OFF


//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
#13: Red LED Test – all 4 quads (LOW)
//44ma
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x0A 0x08}{0x4A 0x1A 0x00}{0x4A 0x1A 0x60}
DELAY: 1500
COMMAND: TENMAPSU IOUT1?
READLINE: TENMAPSU PSUcurrent
The returned current is =  %PSUcurrent%
RANGE: %PSUcurrent% 0.045 0.005 // set the range as per TS014_TEST_SEQUENCER_scripts.docx 						
SUB: TestPassOrFail
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x1A 0x0F}{0x4A 0x0A 0x00} //All Leds OFF

#14: Red LED Test – all 4 quads (MID)
//58mA
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x0A 0x08}{0x4A 0x1A 0x00}{0x4A 0x1A 0x80}
DELAY: 1500
COMMAND: TENMAPSU IOUT1?
READLINE: TENMAPSU PSUcurrent
The returned current is =  %PSUcurrent%
