#19: Blue LED Test – all 4 quads (LOW)
//60ma
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x0A 0x40}{0x4A 0x1A 0x00}{0x4A 0x1A 0x60}
DELAY: 1500
COMMAND: TENMAPSU IOUT1?
READLINE: TENMAPSU PSUcurrent
The returned current is =  %PSUcurrent%
RANGE: %PSUcurrent% 0.060 0.005 // set the range as per TS014_TEST_SEQUENCER_scripts.docx 						
