#20: Blue LED Test – all 4 quads (MID)
//80ma
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x0A 0x40}{0x4A 0x1A 0x00}{0x4A 0x1A 0x80}
DELAY: 1500
COMMAND: TENMAPSU IOUT1?
READLINE: TENMAPSU PSUcurrent
The returned current is =  %PSUcurrent%
RANGE: %PSUcurrent% 0.080 0.005 // set the range as per TS014_TEST_SEQUENCER_scripts.docx 						
SUB: TestPassOrFail
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x1A 0x0F}{0x4A 0x0A 0x00} //All Leds OFF

#21: Blue LED Test – all 4 quads (MAX)
//180ma
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x0A 0x40}{0x4A 0x1A 0x00}{0x4A 0x1A 0xE0}
DELAY: 1500
COMMAND: TENMAPSU IOUT1?
READLINE: TENMAPSU PSUcurrent
The returned current is =  %PSUcurrent%
RANGE: %PSUcurrent% 0.180 0.005 // set the range as per TS014_TEST_SEQUENCER_scripts.docx 						
SUB: TestPassOrFail
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x1A 0x0F}{0x4A 0x0A 0x00} //All Leds OFF

/////////////////////////////////////////////////////

#22: Warning: UV saftey concern.
Warning! Esure the LEDs array is inside the test box and the door is shut.
CLICK_OK:

#23: UV LED Test – all 4 quads (LOW)
//72ma
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x0A 0x80}{0x4A 0x1A 0x00}{0x4A 0x1A 0x60}
DELAY: 1500
COMMAND: TENMAPSU IOUT1?
READLINE: TENMAPSU PSUcurrent
The returned current is =  %PSUcurrent%
RANGE: %PSUcurrent% 0.070 0.005 // set the range as per TS014_TEST_SEQUENCER_scripts.docx 						
SUB: TestPassOrFail
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x1A 0x0F}{0x4A 0x0A 0x00} //All Leds OFF

#24: UV LED Test – all 4 quads (MID)
//97ma
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x0A 0x80}{0x4A 0x1A 0x00}{0x4A 0x1A 0x80}
DELAY: 1500
COMMAND: TENMAPSU IOUT1?
