DELAY: 2500
COMMAND: TENMAPSU IOUT1?
READLINE: TENMAPSU PSUcurrent
The returned current is =  %PSUcurrent%
RANGE: %PSUcurrent% 0.230 0.005 // set the range as per TS014_TEST_SEQUENCER_scripts.docx 						
