#26: UV LED Test - turn ON Quad A.
//20mA
Did 3 LEDs turn on?
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x0A 0x80}{0x4A 0x1A 0x00} {0x4A 0x1A 0x87}
PASS_FAIL:
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x1A 0x0F}{0x4A 0x0A 0x00} //All Leds OFF

#27: UV LED Test - turn ON Quad B.
//20mA
Did 3 LEDs turn on?
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE {0x4A 0x0A 0x80}{0x4A 0x1A 0x00} {0x4A 0x1A 0x8E}
PASS_FAIL:
